{"id":770,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;为了进一步提高本科生党员党性修养，我院本科生党支部于4月8日下午在体育学院三层“党员之家”召开了关于“深入开展党史学习教育工作的基本遵循”的主题学习会议。本次会议由李士荣老师主持，全体本科生党员参加。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;开展党史学习教育，旨在充分发挥党史以史鉴今、资政育人的作用。会上，李士荣老师指出我们当前开展党史学习教育工作的重要性，要求本科生党员不断学习，提高党性修养，发挥党员先锋作用，积极参加学院工作，提高主体意识。推动党史学习教育常态化长效化，并要求我们学好党史、用好党史，从党的历史中汲取智慧和力量，做到学史明理、学史增信、学史崇德、学史力行。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xozMJ2Lmn2nNnRL0R7ZnmQRoRAfU4fa7nzUDo77DnNVVLRL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDnSy4Lky4L7L8nlWRoR7bnRnfUzr2nRr7L47YUmLbnRWFUNCbMm-iM7MFLlVkM4vJv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47YMmNDgtA8pUPcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=12696&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/86E3030C4EBC819D4AA5FD5D312B39D2/BF96254C/1AB77\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xoRVJknln7Ul7Zn0RNsn7CYUmvYozvaaLmGaL7LsMRTfMRv0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2USy4L1h2oRV2MmM2LmTfLzv8LNnfn7lanzGDL4vDozAFLmTfnRvaUmAFLlCiMz7agjfJQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yPLmCbM1bw62P8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=12696&e=.png\"></p><p><br /></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xozMJ2Lmn2nNnRL0R7ZnmQRoRAfU4fa7nzUDo77DnNVVLRL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDnSy4Lky4L7L8nlWRoR7bnRnfUzr2nRr7L47YUmLbnRWFUNCbMm-iM7MFLlVkM4vJv2bjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47YMmNDgtA8pUPcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=12696&e=.png"}